# Enemy Titan: the night 6+ boss body (one now and then on night 5; MatchCoop's c_heavies) - a walking siege tower and the demon with the BIGGEST bubble (the Bulwark and the Aegis carry smaller ones): a
# large field of darkness (about 13 m) that squishes the players' fields back where they meet and
# drains the structures it covers. Enormous health and battery, crushing melee against structures
# and players, and an emitter drain that blacks out a single emitter it leans on. Very slow.
# Near-black block.
Prefab gameEnemyTitan
	CullMode RootOnly
	Component Scene
		Prefab CubeGuy        # the model - see enemyGrunt.pre
			Position 0 3.45 0
			Scale 1.4
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 2.5
		Density 450
		Friction 0
		LockRotation true
		ContactEvents true
	Component Force
		Team 1
		Output 2.2
		Reach 30
		Centered true
	Component Network
	Component GameUnit
		ShortName TITAN
		Color 0.2 0.02 0.08
		HealthMax 3200
		EnergyMax 1350
		ShieldOutput 2.2
		MoveSpeed 1.6
		AttackRange 5
		AttackInterval 2.5
		AttackDamage 140
		PlayerDamage 112
		StructureDamage 900
		EmitterDrain 25
		AlwaysDisplayHealth true
